license: MIT

repository-code: "https://github.com/multi2mech/Blender2SIMBA"

url: "https://github.com/multi2mech/Blender2SIMBA"

repository-artifact: "https://github.com/multi2mech/Blender2SIMBA/releases"

abstract: >
  Blender2SIMBA is the official Blender export pipeline for the SIMBA
  (SIMulation Buffered Animation) framework. The addon evaluates Blender
  geometry, including Geometry Nodes, modifiers, and dynamic topology,
  and exports an intermediate HDF5 representation for conversion into
  optimized SIMBA runtime binaries for Unity.

